# Game_DisplayMode — DJ/Demo Mode (ID 5)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_DisplayMode.h, Game_DisplayMode.cpp
# HTML: data/game_display_setup.html, game_display_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Demo/DJ mode for showing off LED effects. Three modes:
- MANUAL: Direct control from web UI
- RANDOM: Each puck auto-changes independently (3-8s intervals)
- SYNC: All pucks change together (4s cycles)

## CONFIG
- durationMin: auto-stop for non-manual modes
- Per-puck: mute flag (disable click sound)

## MODES
- DISP_MANUAL: Controlled via "play" command
- DISP_RANDOM: Random effects [RAINBOW, BREATHE_MOD4, SINGLE_CHASE, DOUBLE_CHASE, SPARKLE, SPLIT_ROT]
- DISP_SYNC: All pucks same effect [RAINBOW, POLICE, FLASH, DOUBLE_CHASE, LOADING]

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_time, stop, exit, mode_man, mode_rand, mode_sync,
mute_[idx], snd_[idx] (150ms sound),
play,[target],[effectId],[r],[g],[b],[spd],[bri] (comma-separated direct control)

## STATUS JSON
{mode, pucks: [{id, muted, effectId, color (hex)}]}
